# Capacitor: the web build it copies into the native shell is regenerated
# by `npx cap sync` on every build (CI included) -- never hand-edited, so
# it shouldn't be committed. Local Android/Gradle machine state is likewise
# regenerated and often absolute-path-specific to whoever built it.
android/app/src/main/assets/public/
android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.config.json
android/local.properties
android/.gradle/
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/captures/
android/.cxx/
*.keystore
*.jks
